## One source for the rules

The rules above live here and nowhere else. `CLAUDE.md` does not restate them; its first
line is `@AGENTS.md`, which makes Claude Code load this file at session start. To change
a rule, change it here. If you ever find the same rule written in both files, delete the
copy in `CLAUDE.md` rather than trying to keep two versions aligned.
